  personalityNotes: 'THE MIDFIELDER. Possession is the point: continuous reward for keeping the ball within 1.2m (possessionScale, his signature trait), loves the assist as much as the goal. Stays central (high wall penalty), tidy on the controls. Same total incentive budget as everyone (2.2 / 0.0016) - spent on keeping and moving the ball. Weakness by design: passes up shots.'
